when it was expensive,

00:05:33.992 --> 00:05:34.950
or something like that.

00:05:34.950 --> 00:05:35.450
Right?

00:05:35.450 --> 00:05:36.850
Everybody see what I'm saying?

00:05:36.850 --> 00:05:37.980
So this would be--

00:05:37.980 --> 00:05:40.440
So just-- I'm just saying
please, please do that

00:05:40.440 --> 00:05:41.970
